00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:06.328
- I don't think I'd like that

00:00:06.328 --> 00:00:07.269
because in England,

00:00:07.269 --> 00:00:09.265
it's weird to put sweet
and savory together.

00:00:09.265 --> 00:00:10.100
- That sounds okay.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.086
I mean like, I'm not
gonna like not try it.

00:00:12.656 --> 00:00:13.619
(ding)

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:17.920
- Thank you so much.

00:00:19.551 --> 00:00:20.823
- Oooh.

00:00:23.627 --> 00:00:26.030
- Looks like you did this accidentally.

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:26.780
- This seems confusing.

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:28.440
This is like a dream sequence.

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:30.517
- I'm gonna take an instagram of this.

00:00:31.707 --> 00:00:33.023
It's so pretty.

00:00:36.888 --> 00:00:37.921
- Cake and pizza.

00:00:37.921 --> 00:00:39.940
- My mouth is very confused.

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:42.830
- You, no, you get this sprinkle
in the back of your teeth,

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:45.245
so I have sprinkles in
the back of my teeth,

00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:47.090
and I'm mad at you for that.

00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:49.691
- Obviously I like pizza with sprinkles.

00:00:49.691 --> 00:00:50.922
- I don't know how it would be if you had,

00:00:52.252 --> 00:00:54.377
like pepperoni and other things on top.

00:00:54.377 --> 00:00:56.549
- My mouth is separating the pepperoni

00:00:56.549 --> 00:00:58.336
and the pineapple and the normal food

00:00:58.336 --> 00:00:59.810
from the sprinkles right now.

00:00:59.982 --> 00:01:01.079
- I just got chills.

00:01:03.615 --> 00:01:05.008
- A five year old and a stoned person

00:01:05.008 --> 00:01:08.373
i feel have eerily similar kitchen ideas.

00:01:09.249 --> 00:01:10.765
And I don't hate it.

00:01:10.765 --> 00:01:11.757
(mumbles)

